WHAT IS OPEN, AND WHERE
───────────────────────
Several packages this estate publishes are deliberately permissive, so that
anyone can embed them without asking:

  @flashyos/aao, @flashyos/directory, @flashyos/countersign,
  @flashyos/frontdoor, @flashyos/verify, @flashyos/backlog,
  @flashyos/shiplog, @flashylabs/ledger        Apache-2.0

If you are here for a format or a verifier rather than for this property,
those are what you want, and they carry no obligation to us.

THIS IS THE REVERSIBLE CHOICE
─────────────────────────────
A repository can be opened later. A grant already made cannot be withdrawn
from the copies it has already reached. Where the decision had not been
taken deliberately, this file records the position that keeps the decision
available.
